{"surah":86,"ayahs":["وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">مَآ</span>ءِ وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>طَّارِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">قِ</span>","وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">مَآ</span> أَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دْ</span>رَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">ٮٰ</span>كَ مَا <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>طَّارِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">قُ</span>","ٱ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">جْ</span>مُ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>ثَّاقِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">بُ</span>","إِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">ن كُ</span>لُّ نَفْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">سٍ لَّ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">مَّ</span>ا عَلَيْهَا حَافِظٌ","فَلْيَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">نظُ</span>رِ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْإِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">ن</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">سَٰ</span>نُ مِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">مَّ</span> خُلِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">قَ</span>","خُلِقَ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">مِن </span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">مَّآ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">ءٍ دَ</span>افِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">قٍ</span>","يَخْرُجُ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-iqlab\">مِنۢ بَ</span>يْنِ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>صُّلْبِ وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>تَّ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">رَآ</span>ئِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">بِ</span>","إِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span>هُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> عَلَىٰ رَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">جْ</span>عِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">هِۦ</span> لَقَادِرٌ","يَوْمَ تُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">بْ</span>لَى <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">رَآ</span>ئِرُ","فَمَا لَهُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> مِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">ن قُ</span>وَّ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">ةٍ وَ</span>لَا نَاصِرٍ","وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">مَآ</span>ءِ ذَاتِ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>رَّ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">جْ</span>عِ","وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَرْضِ ذَاتِ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>صَّ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دْ</span>عِ","إِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span>هُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> لَقَوْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">لٌ فَ</span>صْلٌ","وَمَا هُوَ بِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْهَزْلِ","إِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span>هُمْ يَكِيدُونَ كَيْدًا","وَأَكِيدُ كَيْدًا","فَمَهِّلِ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">كَٰ</span>فِرِينَ أَمْهِلْهُمْ رُوَيْدَۢا"]}